{"questions":[{"question_id":"lvc57nv7","content":"<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I : Piciric acid is 2,4,6 - trinitrotoluene.</p>\n<p>Statement II : Phenol - 2,4 - disulphonic acid is treated with Conc. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.142ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2714.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to get picric acid.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>","chapter":"compounds-containing-nitrogen","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-6th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift","permalink":"pgiven-below-are-two-statements-p-pstatement-i--pic-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-p5wdi3tuod9tictn","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I : Piciric acid is 2,4,6 - trinitrotoluene.</p>\n<p>Statement II : Phenol - 2,4 - disulphonic acid is treated with Conc. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.142ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2714.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to get picric acid.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Statement I is incorrect, and Statement II is correct. </p>\n<p>The correct name for picric acid is 2,4,6-trinitrophenol, not 2,4,6-trinitrotoluene. Meanwhile, phenol-2,4-disulphonic acid, when treated with concentrated nitric acid (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.142ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2714.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), results in the formation of picric acid. </p>\n<p>Thus, the most appropriate option is :</p>\n<p><strong>Option A</strong>  </p>\n<p>Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नीचे दो कथन दिए गए हैं:</p>\n<p>कथन I : पिक्रिक अम्ल 2,4,6- ट्राइनाइट्रोटालूईन है।</p>\n<p>कथन II : फ़ीनॉल - 2,4 - डाइसल्फॉनिक अम्ल की क्रिया सान्द्र <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.142ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2714.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> के साथ कराने पर पिक्रिक अम्ल प्राप्त होता है।</p>\n<p>उपर्युक्त कथनों के सन्दर्भ में नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सर्वाधिक उपयुक्त उत्तर चुनें:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"कथन I गलत है परन्तु कथन II सही है\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"दोनों कथन I एवं कथन II गलत हैं\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"दोनों कथन I एवं कथन II सही हैं"},{"identifier":"D","content":"कथन I सही है परन्तु कथन II गलत है\n"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>कथन I गलत है, और कथन II सही है। </p>\n<p>पिक्रिक अम्ल का सही नाम 2,4,6-ट्राइनाइट्रोफेनॉल है, न कि 2,4,6-ट्राइनाइट्रोटॉलूईन। इस बीच, फेनॉल-2,4-डाइसल्फोनिक अम्ल, जब सांद्र नाइट्रिक अम्ल (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.142ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2714.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) के साथ उपचारित किया जाता है, तो पिक्रिक अम्ल का निर्माण होता है। </p>\n<p>अतः, सबसे उपयुक्त विकल्प है :</p>\n<p><strong>विकल्प A</strong>  </p>\n<p>कथन I गलत है लेकिन कथन II सही है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"diazonium-salts-and-other-nitrogen-containing-compounds","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["assertion_reason"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-6th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Statement I is inc